  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) whole chicken",
    "4 carrots, halved",
    "4 stalks celery, halved",
    "1 large onion, halved",
    "water to cover",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 teaspoon chicken bouillon granules"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YUy5APu09EYMXI25v5oTab7uN9o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-step-1-31503-be5cbde982144902a4fdb6fc2979f4d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8814/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken, carrots, celery, and onion in a large soup pot; add enough cold water to cover. Bring to a boil over medium heat; reduce heat to low and simmer, uncovered, until meat falls off of the bone, about 90 minutes. Skim off foam every so often, as needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GJ8z8iXTYsOyN-i7Ld38i3LVzJI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-step-3alt-31514-8e10bec89bdb41fc9a6ffb56edbf8dea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8814/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken from the pot and let sit until cool enough to handle; chop meat into pieces, and discard skin and bones.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t-HI7FZy0Bv4mP-WuX7JnMKgnxA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-step-4-31527-ec440c6e83024768a67637a8f483251b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8814/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain out vegetables, reserving the stock; rinse the soup pot and return the stock to the pot. Chop vegetables into smaller pieces; return chopped chicken and vegetables to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8d0WQalVSv6AwvJAQsXX8gRNsgQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-step-6-31538-425e878f0f2b4a7497ce799ddb27832d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8814/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm soup until heated through; season with salt, pepper, and chicken bouillon to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3A9k-miBh1saddc62hI7Ni6UMAU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-step-7-31542-f4b16b0c5ba94787960b2904c9954621.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8814/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QY6AjATjkvsNdpUfDNEcQhkHsj8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8814-homemade-chicken-soup-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-31640-924adc63a78543a7822c5704727f6e4b.jpg"
